OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEmma Barnett reveals she 'had the
OL,4,Ahysterectomy I never wanted to have'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC presenter Emma Barnett has revealed
OL,7,Fshe had a hysterectomy and surgery for
OL,8,Fendometriosis days before a documentary
OL,9,Fshe made about the condition was
OL,10,Fbroadcast.
OL,12,FBarnett, 41, returned to Radio 4's
OL,13,FToday programme on Wednesday morning,
OL,14,Fexplaining she had been absent in
OL,15,Frecent weeks because she was in
OL,16,Fhospital "in a case of life imitating
OL,17,Fwork".
OL,19,FShe told listeners: "I made a programme
OL,20,Fon endometriosis on BBC Two and ended
OL,21,Fup being in hospital for endometriosis.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
