OL,3,AEmma Barnett reveals she 'had the
OL,4,Ahysterectomy I never wanted to have'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"So yes, I've been recuperating, shall
OL,7,Fwe say, from surgery for endometriosis
OL,8,Fand a hysterectomy to boot. So that's
OL,9,Fbeen less fun than the Today programme,
OL,10,Fbut it is lovely to be back."
